<title>UK: DePfa sets 25 billion yen six-year bond.</title>
<headline>DePfa sets 25 billion yen six-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Daiwa and Norinchukin.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEPFA FINANCE NV</p>
<p> AMT    25 BLN YEN    COUPON     2.0	 MATURITY    05.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.15    PAY DATE    05.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  25 BP     REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (M) 10	SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC  15 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
